  "about_item": [
    "Orthopedic memory foam support – Unlike egg crate foam, this orthopedic dog bed uses high-density memory foam to support joints, hips, neck, and spine, making it ideal as a large dog bed, medium dog bed, or memory foam dog bed for everyday comfort",
    "Solid foam bolsters, not shredded fill – The two-sided bolsters use solid foam instead of loose shredded filling, creating a more supportive dog sofa or dog couch bed feel for dogs that like to lean, curl, or rest their head",
    "Multi-layer waterproof protection – The soft velvet outer cover includes a water-resistant inner lining, and 3 removable waterproof covers help protect the foam from spills, drool, and accidents, adding more coverage than a standard waterproof dog bed",
    "Washable removable cover with non-slip base – This dog bed with removable washable cover is designed for easy cleaning, while the non-slip bottom helps keep the bed steady on wood, tile, or laminate floors for daily use",
    "Sizes for small, medium, large, and XL dogs – Available for a wide range of breeds and sleeping styles, whether you need a small dog bed, dog beds for medium dogs, a large washable dog bed, or an xl dog bed for extra room"
