        "position": 1,
        "title": "Prefect for medium dog not extra small",
        "text": "The Pawfect Orthopedic Dog Bed has been a fantastic upgrade for my dog’s comfort. The thick memory foam base provides strong support, helping reduce pressure on my senior dog’s hips and elbows. It’s firm enough to maintain shape but soft enough for cozy naps. The removable cover is durable, easy to unzip, and machine washable, which makes cleaning simple. My dog sleeps more soundly and gets up easier in the mornings now. The bed is lightweight to move between rooms yet feels sturdy. Overall, it’s ideal for dogs of all ages, especially those with joint issues, and it looks great in the living room.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "April 23, 2026",
        "author": "Sarah",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFKYH5WT4PWO6QMT2LV2S3NT6JKQ",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/8e20c7a2-7efe-46f0-97bd-6771fddba207._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_.jpeg",
