      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "Super generous in sizing.",
        "text": "The pawfect orthopedic dog bed is MUCH BIGGER than I expected. It is what I would call large dog sized where my beagle and Samoyed can both fit on it together. It is as wide as a crib mattress but just a tad shorter. The bolsters in it are well supported and stand up when leaned on. They do not sink in or leave an indent.The color is neutral for most any room. I didn't have a problem with offgassing fumes from the foam and it easily went together in a matter of minutes. I also love that dog hair easily slides offof it. It's not a Velcro for dog hair.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "April 19, 2026",
