      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "Easy to assemble, provides great support and washes easily.",
        "text": "I've been searching for a bed for my older dog for sometime. I wanted one that matched my decor, looked like a piece of furniture and provided support. The bed fits all that criteria. The color blends perfectly with my living room and doesn't look like an eyesore. This bed is so soft, sturdy and feels extremely supportive. The fabric on the bed feels so luxurious and expensive. The sides of the bed are higher than other beds I've seen, which allows my dogs to have a nice support for his head. The whole bed is well-made and high quality materials were used. Washing is so easy and since the bed has wide zipper compartments it allows you to remove the inner cushions with ease.",
